Vegetarian in a Spanish-speaking country? Say this before you order 🥗
Guys say "soy vegetariano." Some dishes hide meat or broth, so always ask.

Today's phrases:
• soy vegetariana = I'm vegetarian (f.)
• sin carne = without meat
• hay = there is / there are

